is works in automated backups too of course. The advantage is: you can import these files into a blog with the regular WordPress importer.'=>'您可以选择内置的WordPress导出格式来保存数据。这样做的好处：您可以通过正规的WordPress导入接口将这些文件导入站点。','You can backup all your attachments, also all system files, plugins and themes in a single file. You can <a href="%s">create a job</a> to update a backup copy of your file system only when files are changed.'=>'您可以备份您所有的附件，也是所有系统文件，插件和主题在一个文件中。您可以<a href="%s">创建一个作业</a> 更新，只有当文件发生更改的文件系统的备份副本。','Start jobs per WP-Cron, URL, system, backend or WP-CLI'=>'根据WP-Cron，URL，系统，后端或WP-CLI启动计划','Differential backup of changed directories to Rackspace Cloud Files'=>'差异备份更改目录到Rackspace云文件','Dashboard headingReady to set up a backup job?'=>'准备成立一个备份作业？','Use one of the wizards to plan a backup, or use <a href="%s">expert mode</a> for full control over all options.'=>'使用向导之一，计划备份，或使用<a href="%s">专家模式</a> 超过所有选项的完全控制。','<strong>Please note: You are solely responsible for the security of your data; the authors of this plugin are not.</strong>'=>'<strong>请注意：您对您的数据的安全性自行负责；这个插件的作者都没有。</strong>','<a href="%s">Add a new backup job</a> and plan what you want to save.'=>'<a href="%s">添加一个新的备份作业</a>并计划要保存的东西。','Generate a database backup of WordPress tables and download it right away!'=>'马上生成WordPress数据库备份和下载！','BackWPup News'=>'BackWPup新闻','<strong>RSS Error</strong>: %s'=>'<strong>RSS 错误</strong>：%s','An error has occurred, which probably means the feed is down. Try again later.'=>'发生了一个错误，这可能意味着供稿出错。请稍后再试。','Pro teaser boxThank you for using BackWPup!'=>'感谢您使用BackWPup！','Pro teaser boxGet access to:'=>'可以访问：','Pro teaser boxEasy-peasy wizards to create and schedule backup jobs.'=>'容易向导来创建和调度备份作业。','Pro teaser box, link titleGet BackWPup Pro now'=>'立即获取BackWPup Pro版','Sorry, you don\'t have permissions to do that.'=>'抱歉，您没有权限进行操作。','BackWPup supports multiple cloud services in parallel. This ensures backups are redundant.'=>'BackWPup支持多种云服务并行。这可确保备份是多余的。','Backup to Google Dr